### ScarborMusic — Song API Tests
### Prerequisite: Login first → POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
### Then upload an audio file → POST /api/upload/presigned-url (get audioFileId)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 0. Auth (run first)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 0a. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "testdev@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Lookup endpoints
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1a. Get all categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### 1b. Get all tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tags

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. Create Song (replace AUDIO_FILE_ID with real ID from upload)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2a. Create published song (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/songs
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Midnight Dreams",
  "artistName": "TestDev",
  "albumName": "Test Album",
  "description": "A test song created via API",
  "lyrics": "Verse 1\nDreaming in the midnight glow...",
  "duration": 210,
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "audioFileId": "REPLACE_WITH_REAL_AUDIO_FILE_ID",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "tagIds": [1, 3]
}

### 2b. Create draft song (no cover)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/songs
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Draft Track",
  "artistName": "TestDev",
  "status": "DRAFT",
  "audioFileId": "REPLACE_WITH_REAL_AUDIO_FILE_ID",
  "tagIds": []
}

### 2c. Missing required field (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/songs
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "No Artist",
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "audioFileId": "REPLACE_WITH_REAL_AUDIO_FILE_ID"
}

### 2d. Unauthenticated (should return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/songs
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: access_token=invalid

{
  "title": "Test Song",
  "artistName": "Test Artist",
  "audioFileId": "REPLACE_WITH_REAL_AUDIO_FILE_ID"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. List Songs
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3a. List published songs (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/songs

### 3b. Filter by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/songs?categoryId=1

### 3c. Filter by tag
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/songs?tagId=1

### 3d. Sort by popular
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/songs?sort=popular

### 3e. Paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/songs?page=1&pageSize=5

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. Get Song by ID (replace SONG_ID)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4a. Get song
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/songs/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID

### 4b. Non-existent song (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/songs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 5. Update Song
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 5a. Update title and description
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/songs/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "status": "PUBLISHED"
}

### 5b. Add tags
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/songs/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "tagIds": [1, 2, 3]
}

### 5c. Unauthorized update (should return 401)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/songs/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: access_token=invalid

{
  "title": "Hacked"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 6. Play Count
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 6a. Increment play count
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/songs/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID/play

### Expected:
# { "success": true, "data": { "playCount": "1", "redisCount": 1 } }

### 6b. Multiple plays (call multiple times)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/songs/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID/play
###

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/songs/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID/play

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 7. Delete Song (soft delete)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 7a. Delete song
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/songs/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID

### Expected:
# { "success": true, "message": "Song deleted successfully" }

### 7b. Get deleted song (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/songs/REPLACE_WITH_SONG_ID
